Subject: [PATCH] misc: integrate H432B GPIO braille display
Upstream-Status: Pending

Select the board's cell-frame and power sequencing interface independently
of input support. Text rendering and translation remain in userspace.

---
--- a/drivers/misc/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/misc/Kconfig
@@ -1,0 +2,9 @@
+config H432B_BRAILLE
+	tristate "H432B GPIO braille display"
+	depends on GPIOLIB && OF
+	help
+	  Provide the H432B 32-cell braille frame interface and cell supply
+	  sequencing. Translation, cursor rendering and application policy
+	  belong in userspace.
+	  The cell supply is removed on suspend, detach and system shutdown.
+
--- a/drivers/misc/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/misc/Makefile
@@ -1,0 +2,1 @@
+obj-$(CONFIG_H432B_BRAILLE) += h432b-braille.o
